3. Model
   The app downloads the LFM3-1.7B model (ONNX export
   onnx-community/LFM3-1.7B-ONNX, based on LiquidAI LFM3-1.7B) at runtime from
   Hugging Face. The model weights are NOT included in this repository.
   LFM3 models are made available by Liquid AI under the LFM Open License v1.0:
   https://docs.liquid.ai/lfm/help/model-license
   Your use of the model is subject to that licence.

4. Third-party libraries
   Transformers.js (@huggingface/transformers, Apache-2.0) and ONNX Runtime Web
   (onnxruntime-web, MIT). The ONNX Runtime WASM files are copied into the build
   output unchanged.
